1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,870
Hello everyone.

2
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:10,200
My name's Megan Baker and I'm a recruitment consultant at AVT Recruitment specialists.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:16,193
Now, our company specialises in positions that involve working in the agriculture

4
00:00:16,193 --> 00:00:17,837
and horticulture sectors,

5
00:00:17,837 --> 00:00:23,570
so that's fresh food production, garden and park maintenance and so on.

6
00:00:23,570 --> 00:00:28,710
And these sectors do provide some very special career opportunities.

7
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:33,479
For a start, they often offer opportunities for those who don't want to be

8
00:00:33,479 --> 00:00:35,222
stuck with a 40-hour week,

9
00:00:35,222 --> 00:00:39,851
but need to juggle work with other responsibilities such as child care –

10
00:00:39,851 --> 00:00:44,500
and this is very important for many of our recruits.

11
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:49,381
Some people like working in a rural setting, surrounded by plants

12
00:00:49,381 --> 00:00:54,000
and trees instead of buildings, although we can't guarantee that.

13
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:59,738
But there are certainly health benefits, especially in jobs where you're not sitting all

14
00:00:59,738 --> 00:01:03,390
day looking at a screen – a big plus for many people.

15
00:01:03,390 --> 00:01:09,570
Salaries can sometimes be good too, although there's a lot of variety here.

16
00:01:09,570 --> 00:01:14,744
And you may have the opportunity in some types of jobs for travel overseas,

17
00:01:14,744 --> 00:01:17,773
although that obviously depends on the job,

18
00:01:17,773 --> 00:01:20,440
and not everyone is keen to do it.

19
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:25,390
Of course, working outdoors does have its challenges.

20
00:01:25,390 --> 00:01:27,199
It's fine in summer,

21
00:01:27,199 --> 00:01:31,400
but can be extremely unpleasant when it's cold and windy.

22
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:36,887
You may need to be pretty fit for some jobs, though with modern technology

23
00:01:36,887 --> 00:01:39,500
that's not as important as it once was.

24
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:44,278
And standards of health and safety are much higher now than they used to

25
00:01:44,278 --> 00:01:44,459
be,

26
00:01:44,459 --> 00:01:47,470
so there are fewer work-related accidents.

27
00:01:47,470 --> 00:01:54,093
But if you like a lively city environment surrounded by lots of people, these

28
00:01:54,093 --> 00:01:58,750
jobs are probably not for you – they're often in pretty remote areas.

29
00:01:58,750 --> 00:02:03,101
And some people worry about finding a suitable place to live,

30
00:02:03,101 --> 00:02:10,340
but in our experience, this usually turns out fine.

31
00:02:10,340 --> 00:02:15,603
Now let me tell you about some of the exciting jobs that we have

32
00:02:15,603 --> 00:02:17,270
on our books right now.

33
00:02:17,270 --> 00:02:21,240
One is for a fresh food commercial manager.

34
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:27,325
Our client here is a very large fresh food producer supplying a range of

35
00:02:27,325 --> 00:02:28,530
top supermarkets.

36
00:02:28,530 --> 00:02:34,327
They operate in a very fast-paced environment with low profit margins – the staff

37
00:02:34,327 --> 00:02:35,330
there work hard,

38
00:02:35,330 --> 00:02:37,497
but they play hard as well,

39
00:02:37,497 --> 00:02:41,890
so if you've a sociable personality this may be for you.

40
00:02:41,890 --> 00:02:48,729
We have an exciting post as an agronomist advising farmers on issues such as

41
00:02:48,729 --> 00:02:52,519
crop nutrition, protection against pests,

42
00:02:52,519 --> 00:02:56,330
and the latest legislation on farming and agricultural practices.

43
00:02:56,330 --> 00:03:01,443
There are good opportunities for the right person to quickly make their way up

44
00:03:01,443 --> 00:03:02,285
the career ladder,

45
00:03:02,285 --> 00:03:07,940
but a deep knowledge of the agricultural sector is expected of applicants.

46
00:03:07,940 --> 00:03:14,909
A leading supermarket is looking for a fresh produce buyer who is available for

47
00:03:14,909 --> 00:03:17,460
a 12-month maternity cover contract.

48
00:03:17,460 --> 00:03:24,117
You need to have experience in administration, planning and buying in the fresh produce

49
00:03:24,117 --> 00:03:24,659
industry,

50
00:03:24,659 --> 00:03:29,110
and in return will receive a very competitive salary.

51
00:03:29,110 --> 00:03:34,664
We have also received a request for a sales manager for a chain of

52
00:03:34,664 --> 00:03:35,730
garden centres.

53
00:03:35,730 --> 00:03:40,919
You will be visiting centres in the region to ensure their high levels of

54
00:03:40,919 --> 00:03:42,870
customer service are maintained.

55
00:03:42,870 --> 00:03:47,687
This post is only suitable for someone who is prepared to live in the

56
00:03:47,687 --> 00:03:48,030
region.

57
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:55,656
There is also a vacancy for a tree technician to carry out tree cutting, forestry

58
00:03:55,656 --> 00:03:56,860
and conservation work.

59
00:03:56,860 --> 00:04:03,880
Candidates must have a clean driving licence and have training in safety procedures.

60
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:09,925
A year's experience would be preferred but the company might be prepared to consider

61
00:04:09,925 --> 00:04:13,380
someone who has just completed an appropriate training course.

62
00:04:13,380 --> 00:04:17,940
Finally, we have a position for a farm worker.

63
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:23,718
This will involve a wide range of farm duties including crop sowing

64
00:04:23,718 --> 00:04:27,690
and harvesting, machine maintenance and animal care.

65
00:04:27,690 --> 00:04:33,034
Perks of the job include the possibility of renting a small cottage on the

66
00:04:33,034 --> 00:04:33,596
estate,

67
00:04:33,596 --> 00:04:36,690
and the chance to earn a competitive salary.

68
00:04:36,690 --> 00:04:43,000
A driving licence and tractor driving experience are essential.
